{%- doc -%}
  Single source of truth for whether the gift offer is currently live.
  Outputs "true" when active, nothing otherwise.

  Driven EXCLUSIVELY by the Zaria Promotions app via the shop metafield
  `elixir_promotions.gift_offer_active` — theme settings play no role, so the app's
  Show/Hide/Pause is always what the storefront does.
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  if shop.metafields.elixir_promotions.gift_offer_active.value == true
    echo 'true'
  endif
-%}
